      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Something of addition that might want to be noted is that opening the full settings/social/ect menu makes it so the frozen lower body doesn't rotate with the head. I usually playspace move down, open the menu way below me, then move back up so it's out of the way.\nIt'd be nice to have a proper way to toggle that rotation freeze in case the menu system ever changes.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
